      "reply_to_account_id": null,
      "quoted_tweet_id": null,
      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "8/11- Los Angeles – While supporting our ICE partners in operations in the Los Angeles area, this hostile subject thought it was a good idea to taunt USBP agents with a machete. Our agents were able to identify this individual, thanks to our facial recognition technology and photos from the scene. The subject is a Mexican national, known foot guide, and best of all, wanted for Burglary in Los Angeles. USBP agents quickly returned to the area to arrest him, but he attempted to flee. A short foot pursuit later, he was in cuffs. Every threat is taken seriously. We will use every tool at our disposal to locate and arrest those who think they can evade justice.",
      "text_resolved": "8/11- Los Angeles – While supporting our ICE partners in operations in the Los Angeles area, this hostile subject thought it was a good idea to taunt USBP agents with a machete. Our agents were able to identify this individual, thanks to our facial recognition technology and photos from the scene. The subject is a Mexican national, known foot guide, and best of all, wanted for Burglary in Los Angeles. USBP agents quickly returned to the area to arrest him, but he attempted to flee. A short foot pursuit later, he was in cuffs. Every threat is taken seriously. We will use every tool at our disposal to locate and arrest those who think they can evade justice.",
